         <!--Simplicius v(ir) c(larissimus) et Didyme c(larissima) f(emina) et Innocentius [dormi]entes in pace et / Roscia Calcedonia c(larissima) f(emina) d(eposita) die V non(as) mai(as) post cons(ulatum) d(omini) n(ostri) Gra[tiani] Aug(usti) III et Equiti--><div type="edition" xml:lang="la"><head>Text</head><ab><lb n="1"/>Simplicius <expan><abbr>v</abbr><ex>ir</ex></expan> <expan><abbr>c</abbr><ex>larissimus</ex></expan> et Didyme <expan><abbr>c</abbr><ex>larissima</ex></expan> <expan><abbr>f</abbr><ex>emina</ex></expan> et Innocentius <supplied reason="lost">dormi</supplied>entes in pace et<lb n="2"/>Roscia Calcedonia <expan><abbr>c</abbr><ex>larissima</ex></expan> <expan><abbr>f</abbr><ex>emina</ex></expan> <expan><abbr>d</abbr><ex>eposita</ex></expan> die V <expan><abbr>non</abbr><ex>as</ex></expan> <expan><abbr>mai</abbr><ex>as</ex></expan> post <expan><abbr>cons</abbr><ex>ulatum</ex></expan> <expan><abbr>d</abbr><ex>omini</ex></expan> <expan><abbr>n</abbr><ex>ostri</ex></expan> Gra<supplied reason="lost">tiani</supplied> <expan><abbr>Aug</abbr><ex>usti</ex></expan> III et Equiti</ab></div>
